  "description": "The Lakeland finale. Ride out through the ford, hop the deep pool off its lip and splash through the wide ford to the far end. Collect the apple high on the bank, turn around (Space) and ride all the way back: through the ford, over the pool from the other side and past the start to the finish behind it. Thunder rolls in the distance; keep moving.",
